# The root .gitignore's `scripts/` rule is meant for the monorepo-root scripts/
# folder only, but it also swallows this package's build-critical scripts/
# directory (fix-dist-imports.mjs is required by the `build` script, which runs
# during Netlify's postinstall). Re-include it here so the build works for
# anyone who checks out the repo.
!scripts/
